# OmniGraph frontend API base URL (optional; do not put secrets in VITE_* variables)
#
# Leave unset for same-origin requests. In development, Vite proxies API paths
# to the local FastAPI server (see vite.config.ts).
#
# When frontend and API are deployed on different origins, set this to the public
# API origin and configure the backend CORS allowlist for the frontend origin:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
